    "specimen": {
      "growth_conditions": "Mouse small-intestinal organoids maintained in IntestiCult Organoid Growth Medium (STEM CELL Technologies) with 100 \u00b5g/ml Penicillin-Streptomycin. For light-sheet imaging, FACS-sorted single cells were collected in ENR medium (advanced DMEM/F-12 with 15 mM HEPES (STEM CELL Technologies), 100 \u00b5g/ml Penicillin-Streptomycin, 1x Glutamax, 1x B27, 1x N2 (Thermo Fisher Scientific), 1 mM N-acetylcysteine (Sigma), 500 ng/ml R-Spondin, 100 ng/ml Noggin (PeproTech), 100 ng/ml murine EGF (R&D Systems)); 2500 cells were embedded in a 5 \u00b5l drop of Matrigel/medium at a 60/40 ratio. For the first 3 days the medium was supplemented with 20% Wnt3a-conditioned medium and 10 \u00b5M Y-27632 (ROCK inhibitor), and on the first day additionally with 3 \u00b5M CHIR99021. Medium was exchanged manually every day during acquisition.",
