    "study": {
      "additional_metadata": [],
      "dataset_name": "Liberali Lab LS1 Time-Lapse Organoid Dataset",
      "description": "Live 3D light-sheet time-lapse recordings of mouse intestinal organoids from the Liberali lab. Each store is one cropped organoid ROI, imaged in two fluorescence channels (mem9-GFP plasma membrane, H2B-mCherry nuclei) at 10-minute intervals over several hundred timepoints. Every ROI is provided in three processing variants \u2014 raw, deconvolved and denoised. The deconvolved store additionally carries cell, nuclei and lumen segmentation masks, single-cell tracking converted to GEFF, VTP surface meshes, and per-cell and organoid-level feature tables.",
